{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f8be164e0d7eacb1d4f3aab13aed73a7d01f556e680efc00a40ba42b7f41e331", "ja": "（今日は、翼の宣材写真を撮るために、\n撮影スタジオへやってきたのだが……）", "zh": "（今天为了拍翼的宣传照，\n我们来到了摄影棚……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "11f9539647a38d21a1313b3827daed3db71980398b419b6eac57bfa41d9c8590", "ja": "ねぇねぇ、プロデューサーさん。\n今日のお仕事って、写真を撮るだけなんですよね～？", "zh": "话说，制作人先生。\n今天的工作只有拍照对吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "50038f7af752822725b390780cccd58a97eba039736d95288f0bda2e34683d76", "ja": "そうだけど……いいか、翼。宣材写真は、翼のことを\nみんなに知ってもらうための、大切なものなんだぞ。", "zh": "是没错……听好啰，翼。\n宣传照是让大家认识翼的关键喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "efdf4d4044b2c255e4a611355b6803243858d36e8eef3a721314df84eb7586f3", "ja": "ふ～ん……。でもやっぱり、写真を撮るだけですよね？\n何かもっと、面白いことないかな～……。", "zh": "是喔……但只是单纯拍照对吧？\n有没有其他有趣的事啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5e9ff22f04a78386f3d17324bc47c5137792a48b862d16d6c7233aadb9fb402b", "ja": "あ！　ココって、衣装とかたくさんあるんですよね？\nちょっとだけ、着てみてもいいですか？", "zh": "啊！这里有很多服装吧？\n我可以借穿一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9956faea8beddc1f701381567e54097225a09e157c43b195ca0b7e5bdd40b970", "ja": "ダメだ。誰かの衣装かもしれないのに、\n勝手に着るわけにはいかないだろ？", "zh": "不行，这些服装可能已经有主人了，\n不该擅自拿来穿吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e064880c03daf31d3246eb1ed7c7cdb8bb73cab7562e6b03ac6b5a740e4889ba", "ja": "む～、つまんな～い……。\nじゃあ、外に遊びに行きましょうよ！", "zh": "唔～好无聊～\n……那我们一起去外面玩嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "25dd14c930e35b3049e065b659e5c8f154561de22488f4894d82aa0cfd587e88", "ja": "{$P$}さんとわたしで、\nデートするんです！　絶対、楽しいと思うな～♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生和我去约会！\n绝对会很好玩的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a6bd1c955473b38d8740d4d6aafce5e63e83d95f924941767e37ca0098e8709e", "ja": "（まずいな。翼の興味を撮影に向かわせないと、\nちゃんとした写真が撮れない。翼の興味といえば……）", "zh": "（糟了，如果不让翼对拍照产生兴趣，\n就不能拍出好照片了。翼的兴趣是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_1009", "source_sha256": "1f335e3682fba12a4aef09a2c7980718faf8c883a2f4141da3a7e286d5bd344d", "ja": "（オシャレ関係…！）", "zh": "（有关时尚的事……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2000_p", "source_sha256": "1e67119e336de28d690cd5e29e30585cbc41684d1c82f68f7183c5216e3310d1", "ja": "残念だな。今日はせっかく翼のために、\nプロのメイクさんに来てもらってるのに……。", "zh": "真可惜，难得今天特地为翼\n请来了专业化妆师……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9af26e6166b2496de6a074a5be14960d84f9bc83fd380d49db8856e20f6e550c", "ja": "えっ……それ、ホントですか！？\nプロのメイクさんに、メイクしてもらえるの？", "zh": "咦……真的吗！？\n可以请专业化妆师帮我上妆吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1af38a0aa39f93490ee6a5e8e1d14b302ee894e27cc05a7a96807ed94614a6c9", "ja": "じゃあお願いしたら、大人っぽいメイクとか……\n超カワイイメイク、してもらえますか？", "zh": "那无论是成熟的妆……或超可爱的妆，\n化妆师都能帮我实现心愿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2003_p", "source_sha256": "0ff433cc0a67245c3016099db73428b456e0597ed5aaea9d88471c1519d30f78", "ja": "ああ、きっとしてもらえると思う。", "zh": "嗯，我想化妆师一定可以的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ddf43f31027acf24640d18cbf00df6ab7f36329f5aeb057b210454bd802f2eae", "ja": "わ～い♪　楽しみ～！\nわたし、さっそくメイク室に行ってきますね！", "zh": "哇～♪真期待～！\n那我先去化妆室啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2005_p", "source_sha256": "cb8edddad65743d3501c0677cc1088baf99e9dda44af99c95ab2499e33e4be53", "ja": "（やれやれ、なんとかやる気になってくれたか……\nこのまま、最後までもってくれるといいんだけど）", "zh": "（真是的，总算让她提起干劲了……\n希望她的干劲能就这样维持到最后。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2006_null", "source_sha256": "26bad7a9a0e63c7b8e956ffc3986f65b4a48ad74c64be68c4f7a5220d7922633", "ja": "30分後……", "zh": "30分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bb0c4d5d54d24cdde42b53fe45f4357e2e1b06784ec4023c1779de1664b3ce36", "ja": "えへへへへ……\n{$P$}さんっ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿嘿……\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2008_p", "source_sha256": "d2f4c8ba5e3357d1f475ad09ef9102eb9e400d900eff2874373519fadf84f077", "ja": "お、おお、翼。\nメイクしてもらってきたんだな！", "zh": "哦、哦哦，\n翼已经上好妆了呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "42d34ef23ef20a7495357ba7f22f01fd2f20cd8002a15ac53169726073698ce1", "ja": "はいっ♪　えへへ、どうですか？\nわたし、大人っぽいですか……？", "zh": "是啊♪嘿嘿，怎么样？\n我看起来很成熟吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2010_p", "source_sha256": "3137dc229039094ce447e31cb84c011145966e44b2bbc002129a840b3cae4b33", "ja": "う、うん。\nそうだな……。", "zh": "呃，嗯，\n是啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2011_p", "source_sha256": "a10f7cee5eaa98286e3501ce1d44a42293bff6218b6c6c3db2d1daa85fac204d", "ja": "（自然なナチュラルメイクだけど、少し大人っぽくて\n……普段より、翼の素材のよさが際立ってるな）", "zh": "（虽然上的妆走自然路线，但又有点成熟……\n比平常更能突显翼的好底子呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4a6d8d26cbb084dc0cb9c7da369e6d994c13bd18d06e5b8eb7dc11ebca786c96", "ja": "あ～！\n{$P$}さんの顔、赤くなってる～！", "zh": "啊～！\n{$P$}先生脸红了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1dc558c64c9c5589d2c2e74050f36bc5deecdb7fd2d106bccce54d3e7704004d", "ja": "わたしって、そんなに大人っぽいですか？\nドキドキしちゃう？", "zh": "我有那么成熟吗？\n你是不是小鹿乱撞了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2014_p", "source_sha256": "c09564ad97e3d55c02bcfc99f69e54d5e275e27141cb2eab6fb750f0a0f0b013", "ja": "いや、ドキドキはしないけど……そうだな。\nよく似合ってると思う。", "zh": "不，是没到小鹿乱撞啦……\n但我觉得这样很适合你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0949c2e45d62753508a2f852c4c3e07a85c611df31e4d1997313ca97cbe9c686", "ja": "む～、そんなんじゃダメですよ～！\nもっと、ちゃんとほめてくれなくちゃ……。", "zh": "唔～那样不行啦～！\n你要更用心地夸我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2016_p", "source_sha256": "2e0eb77b7d27174950aacfdf0e7a245296c4e417ba6bd4cb8d542816faed6456", "ja": "わかったわかった。\nメイクも似合ってるし、すごくかわいいぞ！", "zh": "知道了知道了。\n妆很适合你，超可爱的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "163732b7b3282b7392b4379ee3d9de6bb834990b1a5a742133ee805a50c433a1", "ja": "ホントですか～？　えへへ♪", "zh": "真的吗～？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2018_p", "source_sha256": "ae2381d7aff12448e2ca70e4c4352f3a5fc4c5bb54fa774bf6b10c141996fb7c", "ja": "ああ、本当だ。せっかく大人っぽいメイクにして\nもらったんだから、いっぱい写真撮ってもらおうな。", "zh": "嗯，真的。难得上了成熟的妆，\n我们就多拍一些照片吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e9f84eeb17c2497321630349e101dac43044808ea374d8257b0131cfecb009e0", "ja": "は～い♪　{$P$}さんも、\nあとで写真撮っていいですよ～♪", "zh": "好～♪{$P$}先生，\n你之后也可以过来拍我喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_002_2020_p", "source_sha256": "605506b28f7d94123404851306e366ae537960487bceb81f36fc715d82e71da3", "ja": "（……どうにかやる気になってくれたか。\nでもこれで、いい宣材写真が撮れるはずだ！）", "zh": "（……总算让她提起干劲了。\n这样一来，应该能拍出好宣传照的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
